msgid "Alpha?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Last week, Max Andersen https://quarkus.io/blog/road-to-quarkus-3/[explained our plans for Quarkus 3 and Jakarta EE 10]."
msgstr ""

msgid "I published yesterday a more detailed blog post explaining how we are building the Quarkus 3 stream."
msgstr ""

msgid "It is now time to announce Quarkus 3.0.0.Alpha1 which is the first iteration of our Quarkus 3 stream."
msgstr ""

msgid "A few key points about Quarkus 3.0.0.Alpha1:"
msgstr ""

msgid "It is based on Quarkus 2.13.3.Final so it has all the features of this version."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"It targets Jakarta EE 10, except for JPA, where we are still aiming at EE 9.\n"
"Thus we are still using Hibernate ORM 5.6."
msgstr ""

msgid "From the key targets we have for Quarkus 3, some are not there yet:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Eclipse MicroProfile 6 - it is not even released so no surprise there"
msgstr ""

msgid "Switch to the Flow API instead of Reactive Streams - it is a work in progress"
msgstr ""

msgid "As mentioned previously, Hibernate ORM 6"
msgstr ""

msgid "A few things are not working yet, due to upstream issues:"
msgstr ""

msgid "REST Assured only works with Jackson, not with JSON-B, as there is no versions of REST Assured supporting the `jakarta.*` packages."
msgstr ""

msgid "We named this version Alpha1 because it is still a work in progress but it doesn't contain any experimental stuff."
msgstr ""

msgid "It is a very stable `2.13.3.Final` converted to Jakarta EE 10 with some minor additions."
msgstr ""

msgid "As a result, it should already be very usable."
msgstr ""

msgid "Trying out Quarkus 3"
msgstr "Quarkus 3を試してみる"

msgid "For now the easiest way to get started is using https://code.quarkus.io/?S=io.quarkus.platform%3A3.0[code.quarkus.io] or use the Quarkus CLI:"
msgstr "今のところ、最も簡単な方法は、 https://code.quarkus.io/?S=io.quarkus.platform%3A3.0[code.quarkus.io] を使用するか、Quarkus CLIを使用することです："

msgid "Mind you that at this stage, while all the core extensions are available, only parts of the Quarkus platform is present. Not all extensions have yet migrated to Jakarta packages (e.g. Camel Quarkus or Kogito are not yet available)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Upgrading to Quarkus 3"
msgstr "Quarkus 3へのアップグレード"

msgid "For existing applications where all extensions are available, we have an early OpenRewrite recipe that you can try."
msgstr ""

msgid "There is a one-liner that attempts to do it automatically using a JBang script:"
msgstr ""

